# D3-TR-006: Sorption can delay a dye relative to a salt tracer
# Simulation candidate; no runtime observations are claimed.
register lv3
new
new
new
new
new
add v1 water 20mL
add v1 activated_charcoal 0.02g
add v2 water 20mL
add v3 water 20mL
add v4 water 20mL
add v4 methyl_orange 0.001g
add v4 NaCl 0.0001mol
add v6 water 20mL
transport v1 v2 v3 from v4 to v5 steps 2 courant 0.5
inspect
transport v1 v2 v3 from v6 to v5 steps 6 courant 0.5
measure v5 uvvis
measure v5 conductivity
look v1
inspect
